SOAPBOX: Conditions were not very good Saturday and no better on Sunday.
SOAPBOX: EU opened an hour later on Sunday. I'm always amazed at what
SOAPBOX: good ears folks have being able to pull out my liittle peanut
SOAPBOX: whistle Never heard a JA but heard plenty of folks working them.
SOAPBOX: Heard two KL's but no joy there either. At times, rope-burn
SOAPBOX: might be more fun. I might go back to 100W next time with the
SOAPBOX: cycle going downhill. Thanks - 73 tom Rig = TenTec Eagle @ 5
SOAPBOX: Watts. Antennas = Mag Loop (40 thru 15), an Isotron-80, and an
SOAPBOX: indoor 10 meter dipole, all in the attic 12' above garage floor.
